OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly
OL,6,Fcloudy through the evening and
OL,7,Fovernight with showers merging into
OL,8,Fsome longer spells of rain, heaviest
OL,9,Fover the Northwest Highlands. Strong
OL,10,Fto gale force southwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudy morning with showers
OL,13,For longer spells of rain and strong to
OL,14,Fgale force westerly winds. Wind and
OL,15,Fshowers will ease later in the day
OL,16,Fwith some bright intervals.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
